{
  "source": "Prompts/Understand-opener-2.mp4",
  "duration": 113.731375,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.56,
      "text": "Sometimes, working with AI feels like having a PhD expert right at your side."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.26,
      "end": 8.26,
      "text": "Other times, it makes a mistake you'd expect from a six-year-old."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.88,
      "end": 11.38,
      "text": "How can the exact same tool do both of these things?"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.12,
      "end": 14.88,
      "text": "The explanation starts with what AI is not."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.54,
      "end": 16.6,
      "text": "First, it isn't magic."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.18,
      "end": 18.3,
      "text": "It is not a person."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.86,
      "end": 21.02,
      "text": "And it is not ordinary software, either."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.76,
      "end": 25.94,
      "text": "Because it is none of these things, the only way to explain its behavior is to look at"
    },
    {
      "start": 25.94,
      "end": 27.22,
      "text": "what actually happens inside."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.92,
      "end": 28.94,
      "text": "Think about driving a car."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.4,
      "end": 32.04,
      "text": "You can get very good at it without ever opening the hood."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.62,
      "end": 35.76,
      "text": "But when a warning light flashes, surface-level knowledge isn't enough."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.36,
      "end": 39.02,
      "text": "Knowing what's underneath is how you diagnose the problem and"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.02,
      "end": 40.46,
      "text": "understand what the car can do."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.06,
      "end": 43.5,
      "text": "The exact same logic applies to artificial intelligence."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.14,
      "end": 45.64,
      "text": "As you see at the bottom of this screen,"
    },
    {
      "start": 46.18,
      "end": 48.84,
      "text": "knowing how it works helps you be smarter than the tool."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.38,
      "end": 52.66,
      "text": "So it's time to look under the hood and step inside the machine."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.46,
      "end": 57.22,
      "text": "We are going to examine this structure slowly, one piece at a time."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.22,
      "end": 59.08,
      "text": "Some of this will be new to you, but"
    },
    {
      "start": 59.08,
      "end": 62.08,
      "text": "every single piece connects directly to the one right before it."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.66,
      "end": 65.56,
      "text": "You do not need to memorize every technical term we introduce."
    },
    {
      "start": 66.08,
      "end": 69.84,
      "text": "Your only goal is to watch how your words travel through these blocks and"
    },
    {
      "start": 69.84,
      "end": 70.52,
      "text": "become an answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.08,
      "end": 74.74,
      "text": "This section map on your screen lays out the three specific questions"
    },
    {
      "start": 74.74,
      "end": 76.04,
      "text": "we will use to guide us."
    },
    {
      "start": 76.72,
      "end": 79.2,
      "text": "First, where does the AI get all that knowledge?"
    },
    {
      "start": 79.88,
      "end": 83.8,
      "text": "Second, how does the AI seem to understand what I ask?"
    },
    {
      "start": 84.32,
      "end": 87.34,
      "text": "And third, how does it actually come up with its answers?"
    },
    {
      "start": 88.22,
      "end": 90.9,
      "text": "We will leave these unanswered for the moment, but"
    },
    {
      "start": 90.9,
      "end": 94.02,
      "text": "they form the definitive roadmap for the rest of our journey."
    },
    {
      "start": 94.66,
      "end": 95.94,
      "text": "Look at the top banner on this image."
    },
    {
      "start": 96.68,
      "end": 99.22,
      "text": "By the time we finish answering those three questions,"
    },
    {
      "start": 99.74,
      "end": 101.72,
      "text": "the machine won't feel like magic anymore."
    },
    {
      "start": 102.44,
      "end": 104.26,
      "text": "And as the note at the bottom reminds us,"
    },
    {
      "start": 104.64,
      "end": 106.98,
      "text": "you just need to take it a piece at a time."
    },
    {
      "start": 107.6,
      "end": 108.42,
      "text": "We have our roadmap."
    },
    {
      "start": 109.18,
      "end": 110.18,
      "text": "Now, let's turn the page."
    }
  ],
